{
  "_doc": "Cluster Plexmedia — production topology for DTFS soak. DC LELI is the storage anchor (40 Mbps DSL-class) with all 3 quorum managers + primary storage + a Plex viewer. DC TORO (400 Mbps) holds an SSD warm tier + Plex viewer. DC NRB (1 Gbps) is the ingest path: fresh downloads land here on HDD and replicate to LELI. All storage on LVM-Thin pools pve01_ssd01..02 + pve01_usb01..04. Scaled-down from real (50 TB primary → 600 GB; 1 TB warms → 200 GB) so the soak fits the 14-disk pve01 host.",
